  "$comment": "Transcribed from the Approval Order of the Young Chakma Association (Zone), Bageisury — Order No. 015003/01/2026-27/ZYCA-B, dated 7 September 2026 — which approves the Branch Executive Committee of Tellosora (Sumsilui) for a period of two years from the date of approval. Three bodies are named in it: Office Bearers, Executive Members, and the Advisory and Auditory Board. Two things were changed in transcription: designations are written out where the order abbreviates them ('Gen. Secretary' becomes 'General Secretary', 'E M' becomes 'Executive Member'), and each body's Sl. No. was offset (1-13, 21-25, 31-35) so the three lists keep their own order inside one collection. A dash in the order's designation column is stored as no position at all. The F./NAMES column is recorded as fatherName and belongs to the branch's own record — it never reaches the public page. No phone number here is shown on the site until 'Show contact publicly' is turned on for that person in Admin → Members.",
